<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= test.title %> — Exercise Test</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="center-page">
    <div class="card" style="max-width:560px; width:100%;">
      <h1>Hi <%= candidate.name %> 👋</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">You've been invited to take the exercise test for <strong><%= test.title %></strong>.</p>
      <% if (test.description) { %><p><%= test.description %></p><% } %>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3" style="margin: 20px 0;">
        <div class="card stat-card" style="padding:14px;">
          <div class="num" style="font-size:1.4rem;"><%= test.totalQuestions %></div>
          <div class="label">Questions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat-card" style="padding:14px;">
          <div class="num" style="font-size:1.4rem;"><%= test.timeLimitMinutes %> min</div>
          <div class="label">Time limit</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat-card" style="padding:14px;">
          <div class="num" style="font-size:1.4rem;"><%= test.passingPercent %>%</div>
          <div class="label">Passing score</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul style="color:#374151; font-size:0.92rem;">
        <li>All questions are multiple choice with a single correct answer.</li>
        <li>The timer starts as soon as you click "Start Test" and cannot be paused.</li>
        <li>The test auto-submits when time runs out, so answer as you go.</li>
        <li>Once started, reopening this link resumes the same test — it does not restart the timer.</li>
      </ul>

      <form method="post" action="/test/<%= token %>/start">
        <button class="btn" type="submit" style="width:100%; justify-content:center; margin-top:10px;">Start Test</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
